<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>1.<sp/>Implement<sp/>the<sp/>SPI<sp/>interface<sp/>(see<sp/>platform_integration.md)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">class<sp/>MySpi<sp/>:<sp/>public<sp/>tle92466ed::SpiInterface&lt;MySpi&gt;<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...<sp/>implement<sp/>required<sp/>methods</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>2.<sp/>Create<sp/>driver<sp/>instance</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">MySpi<sp/>spi;</highlight></codeline>
