<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>📖<sp/>API<sp/>Reference</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>Method<sp/>|<sp/>Description<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|--------|-------------|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`Init()`<sp/>|<sp/>Initialize<sp/>the<sp/>driver<sp/>and<sp/>hardware<sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
